{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><p>現年51歲旅遊達人杜如風近日憑全新旅遊節目《跟風旅行團》強勢回歸幕前，卻意外引發網民於社交平台Threads瘋 …</p><p></p>\n<p>現年51歲旅遊達人杜如風近日憑全新旅遊節目《跟風旅行團》強勢回歸幕前，卻意外引發網民於社交平台Threads瘋狂討論其年輕時期神顏與超狂家底。面對外界多年來對其身形與獨特主持風格指點，她暗中經歷長達9個月地獄式特訓並成功減去逾20磅。這位被昔日幕後人員譽為全台最靚女藝人背後隱藏着令人咋舌之雙學霸驚人履歷。</p>\n<h2>舊照出土被指撞樣阿Sa 幕後公認「TVB最靚」</h2>\n<p>從網民翻出的舊照可見，2007年剛憑無綫生活台節目《流行東京》出道的杜如風，留有一頭烏黑長髮，笑容甜美且散發濃厚日系氣質。不少網民驚艷留言指她年輕時「索到爆炸」，瘦削時期更有幾分神似蔡卓妍（阿Sa）。更有網民爆料指，昔日曾向TVB負責打燈及收音的幕後人員打聽「全TVB最靚女藝人」，結果不少資深幕後異口同聲大讚是杜如風；由於幕後人員日常近距離對住藝人「最為嚴苛」，令樓主亦不禁感嘆其全盛時期絕對是「10/10」級別。<br/>\n<figure><a href=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/179499546123784988_17491007476afd7505bf8df.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"d9c57c28-dec3-4e09-aef2-c0d02c452775.jpeg/raw\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"484\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/179499546123784988_17491007476afd7505bf8df.jpg\" width=\"960\"/></a><figcaption>（圖片來源：threads）</figcaption></figure>\n</p>\n<p><figure><a href=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/179499546243298428_15154100906afd7506ce584.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"杜如風 g （圖片來源：網民圖片）\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"484\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/179499546243298428_15154100906afd7506ce584.jpg\" width=\"960\"/></a><figcaption>貼舊照激似山口百惠X張曼玉（圖片來源：網民圖片）</figcaption></figure>\n</p>\n<p><figure><a href=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/179499546305769548_19423836086afd750778168.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"912093873_17976633546168424_4656578990852380165_n.jpg/raw\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"484\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/179499546305769548_19423836086afd750778168.jpg\" width=\"960\"/></a><figcaption>網民感歎：第一輯嘅流行東京嗰時真係索到爆炸（圖片來源：TVB）</figcaption></figure>\n</p>\n<p><figure><a href=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/17949954648343929_1645690396afd75094a112.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"杜如風 g 大家覺得呢張相又似邊個？（圖片來源：IG@toyufung）\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"484\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/17949954648343929_1645690396afd75094a112.jpg\" width=\"960\"/></a><figcaption>大家覺得呢張相又似邊個？（圖片來源：IG@toyufung）</figcaption></figure>\n</p>\n<h2>《跟風旅行團》轉戰首爾狂減逾20磅</h2>\n<p>面對大眾長期聚焦其外貌與體態變化，她早前秘密進行為期9個月地獄式運動特訓，成功甩肉逾20磅。她以煥然一新輕盈姿態帶領攝製隊飛往韓國首爾，拍攝於11月16日正式首播全新節目《跟風旅行團》。節目中她化身真人版鍵盤戰士，親身實測網上過100萬點擊人氣打卡店，不僅克服畏高挑戰小型飛機，更在Oppa Café大晒苦練韓文與男神互動。<br/>\n<figure><a href=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/178667986669446747_2180282186a7e923b171d9.png\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"杜如風 跟風旅行團 杜如風直言瘦身絕非無緣無故（圖片來源：IG@Helen To 杜如風）\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"484\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/178667986669446747_2180282186a7e923b171d9.png\" width=\"960\"/></a><figcaption>杜如風直言瘦身絕非無緣無故（圖片來源：IG@Helen To 杜如風）</figcaption></figure>\n</p>\n<h2>杜如風遺傳父親電影基因 獲封真學霸</h2>\n<p>雖然她經常自嘲為「世界級港女」，現實中卻擁有極具分量家庭背景與亮眼履歷。其已故父親杜惠東生前為嘉禾電影公司宣傳部經理，母親盧佩貞則為退休中學教師。她早年赴加拿大升學並畢業於著名學府麥馬士達大學，在學期間更勇奪全國日本語演講比賽冠軍獲日本駐加使館人員賞識。畢業後她順利入讀被譽為「女子東大」頂尖國立學府東京御茶水女子大學主修日本文學，練就出一口流利日語。</p>\n<h2>網民激讚《跟風旅行團》高顏值才女</h2>\n<p>一連串舊照與驚人學歷曝光後，大批網民對其印象徹底改觀，紛紛於各大討論區留下熱烈迴響。不少網民驚艷留言指她年輕時「索到爆炸」，並大讚現時成功減重的她「宜家瘦返個樣OK」。對於她精通日文兼具備深厚文化底蘊，有網民直指她是名副其實「人生贏家」，認為她從當年高顏值才女蛻變成如今收放自如綜藝女王，至今依然被網民熱烈討論。\n</p>\n<p><figure><a href=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/179499546596461420_11854590796afd750abd7df.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"WhatsApp Image 2026-11-18 at 17.39.29.jpeg/raw\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"484\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/179499546596461420_11854590796afd750abd7df.jpg\" width=\"960\"/></a><figcaption>（圖片來源：threads）</figcaption></figure>\n</p>\n<p><figure><a href=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/179499546811077984_3944328536afd750c89d59.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"WhatsApp Image 2026-11-18 at 17.39.31.jpeg/raw\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"484\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/179499546811077984_3944328536afd750c89d59.jpg\" width=\"960\"/></a><figcaption>（圖片來源：threads）</figcaption></figure>\n</p>\n<p><figure><a href=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/179499546941981305_7214609826afd750dc34d3.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"WhatsApp Image 2026-11-18 at 17.39.31 (1).jpeg/raw\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"484\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/179499546941981305_7214609826afd750dc34d3.jpg\" width=\"960\"/></a><figcaption>（圖片來源：threads）</figcaption></figure>\n</p>\n<p><figure><a href=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/179499547068590086_15840930216afd750f0d20c.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"WhatsApp Image 2026-11-18 at 17.39.31 (2).jpeg/raw\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"484\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/179499547068590086_15840930216afd750f0d20c.jpg\" width=\"960\"/></a><figcaption>（圖片來源：threads）</figcaption></figure>\n</p>\n<p>還有什麼演唱會消息？<i></i></p>\n<p>無論是本地歌手還是外地歌手都即將在香港舉行演唱會，即睇：<b><a href=\"https://www.gotrip.hk/%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82/%E6%BC%94%E5%94%B1%E6%9C%83-%E6%99%82%E9%96%93%E8%A1%A8-%E9%96%80%E7%A5%A8%E8%B3%87%E8%A8%8A-plt-777443/?utm_source=faq&amp;utm_medium=organic&amp;utm_campaign=%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82tag\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">演唱會時間表及購票資訊</a></b>，包括<b><a href=\"https://www.gotrip.hk/%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82/mirror%E6%BC%94%E5%94%B1%E6%9C%83-%E8%A3%9C%E5%A0%B4-%E9%96%80%E7%A5%A8-plt-816344/?utm_source=faq&amp;utm_medium=organic&amp;utm_campaign=%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82tag\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">MIRROR演唱會門票兌換安排</a></b>、<b><a href=\"https://www.gotrip.hk/%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82/%E5%AE%B9%E7%A5%96%E5%85%92%E6%BC%94%E5%94%B1%E6%9C%83-%E6%BE%B3%E9%96%80-%E9%A6%99%E6%B8%AF-plt-801047/?utm_source=faq&amp;utm_medium=organic&amp;utm_campaign=%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82tag\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">容祖兒</a></b>、<b><a href=\"https://www.gotrip.hk/%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82/%E9%84%AD%E7%A7%80%E6%96%87-%E6%BC%94%E5%94%B1%E6%9C%83-%E9%96%80%E7%A5%A8-%E7%B4%85%E9%A4%A8-plt-807968/?utm_source=faq&amp;utm_medium=organic&amp;utm_campaign=%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82tag\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">鄭秀文</a></b>、<b><a href=\"https://www.gotrip.hk/%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82/%E5%BC%B5%E5%AD%B8%E5%8F%8B-%E6%BC%94%E5%94%B1%E6%9C%83-%E9%96%80%E7%A5%A8-plt-786591/?utm_source=faq&amp;utm_medium=organic&amp;utm_campaign=%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82tag\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">張學友</a></b>、<b><a href=\"https://www.gotrip.hk/%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82/%E9%84%AD%E4%B8%AD%E5%9F%BA%E6%BC%94%E5%94%B1%E6%9C%83%E6%BE%B3%E9%96%80-%E9%96%80%E7%A5%A8-plt-835218/?utm_source=faq&amp;utm_medium=organic&amp;utm_campaign=%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82tag\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">鄭中基</a></b>、<b><a href=\"https://www.gotrip.hk/%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82/%E6%BA%AB%E6%8B%BF%E6%BC%94%E5%94%B1%E6%9C%83-%E9%96%80%E7%A5%A8-%E5%94%AE%E7%A5%A8-plt-829876/?utm_source=faq&amp;utm_medium=organic&amp;utm_campaign=%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82tag\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">溫拿</a></b>、<b><a href=\"https://www.gotrip.hk/%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82/%E7%BE%85%E5%BF%97%E7%A5%A5%E6%BC%94%E5%94%B1%E6%9C%83-%E9%A6%99%E6%B8%AF-%E9%96%80%E7%A5%A8-%E5%BA%A7%E4%BD%8D%E8%A1%A8-plt-835184/?utm_source=faq&amp;utm_medium=organic&amp;utm_campaign=%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82tag\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">羅志祥</a></b>等。</p>\n<p>除了演唱會，還有什麼消閒娛樂活動？<i></i></p>\n<p>喜愛宅在家的話，觀看<b><a href=\"https://www.gotrip.hk/%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82/netflix%E6%8E%A8%E8%96%A6-%E7%BE%8E%E5%8A%87-%E6%97%A5%E9%9F%93%E5%8F%B0%E5%8A%87-plt-576203/?utm_source=faq&amp;utm_medium=organic&amp;utm_campaign=%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82tag\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">Netflix劇集</a></b>和<b><a href=\"https://www.gotrip.hk/%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82/bl%E5%8A%87-netflix-plt-583838/?utm_source=faq&amp;utm_medium=organic&amp;utm_campaign=%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82tag\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">BL劇</a></b>最好不過。如果喜歡外出走走的你，也可到這些<b><a href=\"https://www.gotrip.hk/%E9%A6%99%E6%B8%AF%E5%A5%BD%E5%8E%BB%E8%99%95/%E5%AE%A4%E5%85%A7%E5%A5%BD%E5%8E%BB%E8%99%95-629923/?utm_source=faq&amp;utm_medium=organic&amp;utm_campaign=%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82tag\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">室內好去處</a></b>室內遊樂場、溜冰場、自助烘焙店等盡玩室內活動。想要親親大自然，也可到離島走一走，即睇：<b><a href=\"https://www.gotrip.hk/%E9%A6%99%E6%B8%AF%E5%A5%BD%E5%8E%BB%E8%99%95/%E9%A6%99%E6%B8%AF-%E5%81%87%E6%9C%9F%E5%A5%BD%E5%8E%BB%E8%99%95-%E9%9B%A2%E5%B3%B6%E4%B8%80%E6%97%A5%E9%81%8A-%E6%A2%85%E7%AA%A9-%E6%9D%B1%E9%BE%8D%E5%B3%B6-gt01-420918/?utm_source=faq&amp;utm_medium=organic&amp;utm_campaign=%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82tag\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">離島行程攻略</a></b>或是行山，這些<b><a href=\"https://www.gotrip.hk/%E9%A6%99%E6%B8%AF%E9%83%8A%E9%81%8A/%E9%A6%99%E6%B8%AF%E8%A1%8C%E5%B1%B1%E5%A5%BD%E5%8E%BB%E8%99%95-%E7%B0%A1%E5%96%AE%E5%88%9D%E7%B4%9A%E6%96%B0%E6%89%8B%E8%B7%AF%E7%B7%9A-org115-515293/?utm_source=faq&amp;utm_medium=organic&amp;utm_campaign=%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82tag\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">行山好去處</a></b>路線簡易，新手也適合。</p>\n<p></p>\n<p>\n<i></i>\nTags :\n<a href=\"https://www.gotrip.hk/tag/threads%e7%86%b1%e8%ad%b0/\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">threads熱議</a><a href=\"https://www.gotrip.hk/tag/%e6%9d%9c%e5%a6%82%e9%a2%a8/\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">杜如風</a><a href=\"https://www.gotrip.hk/tag/%e8%b7%9f%e9%a2%a8%e6%97%85%e8%a1%8c%e5%9c%98/\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">跟風旅行團</a> </p>\n<p>\n<i></i>\n<p>\n資料或影片來源：<a href=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/3545431\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">原文刊於新假期</a>\n</p>\n</p><p></p>\n<a href=\"https://www.gotrip.hk/category/%e7%94%9f%e6%b4%bb/%e5%a8%9b%e6%a8%82/\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">娛樂</a>\nNov 18 2026\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n<p></p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-18T11:24:00.957364+00:00","quality":{"score":3,"chars":1512,"images":9,"source":"GoTrip","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-18T09:51:15+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-18T11:37:29.964723+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-18T11:17:20.924373+00:00","content_hash":"c2d361aedbacd759f2cb662843a16283e6793c5020fd973dfedead9794a67100","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}